    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bahangi na balangi balomolomo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ahene na a bahangi a balomolomo baalīho ū mu banhū, gīt'ūmo nū mu bing'we bakwandya kwilonga balangi balomolomo; bayenha mu nyasala sala malange ga, nyakenaagūji, biyenhele wangū boi benekīlī mihayo ya kūbakenaagūla kūlwa kūnema ū Seeba ūyo wabagūla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bingī bakūyūlondeela nhūngwa jabo ja malofu, ū mu gīko ī nzīla ja būtūngīlīja jikūyūsondagūlwa kūlwa nguno yabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na bakūyūtūmamīla mihayo mikondooku kūlwa nguno ya kwikūmva kwabo, bipandīkīla solobo; ū nsango gwabo a benabo gūtūūlilwe kūfuma kale na kale, nūgo gūtūdīla ū kūshika, nū kūkenaagūka kwabo kūtatindīlile! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Mulungu atūbaleka gīko dūhū; gīt'ūmo atabalekile a bamalaika abo bakīīta shibi, abo akabaponya mu kūlimu, ūbalugalīla mu machongo ga giiti balang'hanwe ng'wenūmo balindīīle nsango. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nī sī ya kale atīlekile gīko dūhū, akīkenaagūla n'ihūūma; ūbayagaja pye a banhū, nguno baalī na nhūngwa ja malofu, ūneka Noa dūhū ūyo walī ntangaja wa būtūngīlīja, na bangī mpungatī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama ī mizengo ya Sodoma na Gomola, nayo akīgwisīja nsango, wīpemba. Wīgalūcha kūbiza mabu, yūbiza būlolelo wa mhayo ūyo akūbīītīla abo batogilwe kwikala mu nhūngwa jabūbi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūmpīja Lutu, ūyo walī ntūngīlīja; munhū ūyo boolī bompīnīhaja ū būsoso bo nhūngwa ja bakenaagūji benabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Nguno īkī walī ntūngīlīja ū munhū ng'wenūyo, aho wikalaga hamò nabo a bakenaagūji benabo, walī waluha no ū mung'holò yakwe, ū kwikala ūjibona na kūjiigwa būlī lūshikū ī nhūngwa jabo ja malofu). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nose hū kūhaya ū Seeba amanile chiza no ū kūbapīja a beela, bīnge ū mu kūgeng'wa. Alīyo abo batī batūngīlīja, a bene abalang'hanile kūshisha līshike ī likanza lya nsango, ū mu lūshikū lo kūlamulwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakūluha no ū mu nsango gwenūyo abo bakisosohajaga kūlwa kūkūūbīlīja mihayo ya kwikūmva kwa mīlī, na a badalahīja ba būsugi. Nguno a banhū benabo bagimu, nīyo bikumīlīja; hangī batogohaga nūūlū kūbasondagūla abo bigelile kūkūjiwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakīītaga īyo nūūlū bamalaika batagimaga kwīyīta, nūūlū īkī a bene balī na nguzu na būdūla kūtinda. A boi batababūūlaga a benabo ū kū būtongi bo ng'wa Seeba mu kūbasondagūla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a benaba balī gītī shiinū ījo jitī na masala, ījo jikabyalagwa kūlwa kūding'wa na kūkenaagūlwa dūhū; nguno bakasondagūlaga mihayo īyo batayitegelegije nūūlū hado. Ū mhayo ūyo bakagwītaga gwenūyo gūlī gwa kūbakenaagūla boi benekīlī; na ng'hana bakūkenaagūka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakwanukūla mheela yabūbi kūlwa nhūngwa jabo ja malofu, nguno bakwītaga mihayo misoso na līīmi hose, kūlwa kwiganika gīkī balīīta ya kūyeja. A banhū benabo balī mabbado ga kūdimya minala. Ūlū balī hamò ning'we mu makanza ga būyegi ba kwikala bakwilembagūlaga mihayo yabo ya kwikumīlīja! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Banhū ba miso gokalile būshihani, nū kwikūmva kwabo kwa kwīta ī yabūbi kūtashilaga. Balemba lembi ba banhū abo bataalī kūbiza na nguzu ū mu kūzunya. Balī nang'holò jimanīlījiwe mhayo gwa kwikūmva shibi; baana ba ng'wizumo! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Batīmo ū mu nzīla ī ngololoku nūūlū hado, bahūbīkile; balī balondeeji ba nhūngwa ja ng'wa Balaamu ng'witūnja o ng'wa Beoli, ūyo akatogwa mheela ya nyabbūūlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū mu būhahaalīzu bokwe wenūbo ūhang'wa, nzobe īyo ītayombaga yūnyombya n'ilaka lya banhū; yūbiza yakaga lūtūga lo ng'hangi! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū benaba balī nzwinzī ng'halamuku jitī na minzī, malunde mabbūūpu, ga kwikala gakūhūhūūjiagwa nyaga; balindīīlilwe giiti sha gamha, īsho batūūlīlilwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakikumīlījaga kūnū bakūyombaga mihayo mitaale alīyo midūhū, nūūlū īkī īkadutaga maganiko ga banhū abo kwikūmva kwabo kwa mīlī kūbaheebile; hūna ū mu gīko bayūbagwasha abo bakūpūlūgūkaga kwīnga mu makono ga banhū ba nhūngwa ja malofu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakabisagījaga wiyabī, alīyo a boi benekīlī balī mu būsese wa shibi, nguno ūyo aheebilwe na mhayo gose gose, ū ng'wenūyo nsese ū kū mhayo gwenūyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Īkī ūlū gīkī bakapūlūgūka bīnga ū mu būsoso bo mu sī aho bang'witegeleja ū Seeba na Mpīja wise Yesu Kilisito, alīyo hangī ī mihayo yenīyī yūbaheeba yūbitaligīnja, ī ng'halīlo yabo īlī yabūbi kūtinda ū wandījo wabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno īlī hambū hambū ūlū ni baalī batīmanile gete ī nzīla ya būtūngīlīja, kūtinda kwīmana hūna būgalūka na kūlekana nasho ī shilagīlo sheela īsho bakinhwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu gīko bakwīshikīlījaga ī mihayo ya lūsumo lwa ng'hana ūlo lūhayile gīkī, “Ī mva īkashokelaga malūki gayo!” Na gīkī, “Ī ngulubī nūūlū yoojiwa īkashokaga hangī kūgalagala mu tembe!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
